---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Melody Tran" description="A little about Melody Tran.">
  <main>
    <div class="content-with-image">
      <div class="photo-container">
        <img src="/about-photo.jpg" alt="Melody Tran" class="about-photo" />
      </div>

      <div class="text-section">
        <p class="lead">Hi, I'm Melody.</p>

        <p>
          I'm a product designer who's spent most of my life figuring things out
          without a clear map.
        </p>

        <p>
          My work lives where systems thinking, strategy, and craft overlap, and I
          enjoy making things feel simple without losing what makes them work.
          I've spent the past several years testing that instinct on complex
          enterprise products. The same instinct comes just as much from the
          patience and structure I first learned through practicing and teaching
          piano.
        </p>

        <p>
          Outside of work, I'm usually chasing the same feeling, figuring
          something out for the first time:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Traveling</li>
          <li>Snorkeling</li>
          <li>Escape rooms and board games</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          If you'd like to talk about my work, or any of the projects here, I'd
          love to <a href="mailto:yenthuc.tran112@gmail.com">hear from you</a>.
        </p>

        <a class="resume" href="/melody-tran-resume.pdf" download>
          Download résumé
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M10 3v10m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 16h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;
  }

  .content-with-image {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .text-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .photo-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }


  .photo-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ff8a8a 0%, #ff6b6b 40%, #e63946 70%, #a4161a 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow:
      0 6px 14px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.4),
      0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
      inset -2px -2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25),
      inset 2px 2px 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),
      0 0 8px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.3);
    z-index: 10;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2));
  }

  .about-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    object-fit: cover;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    filter: contrast(1.05) brightness(0.98);
  }

  .about-photo::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0;
  }

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4em;
    padding-left: 1.25em;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  li::marker {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }

  .resume {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    padding: 0.65em 1.1em;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease),
      border-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease);
  }

  .resume:hover {
    border-color: var(--fg);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .content-with-image {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-photo {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    main {
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
